const description = '想了解高雄看護與高雄看護中心？本文系統介紹高雄看護的種類、看護中心的角色與功能，以及如何選擇適合自己家庭的照護方案。';
const date = '2026-05-27';
const keywords = ['高雄看護', '高雄看護中心'];
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} type="article">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
    {JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": title,
      "description": description,
      "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "宇涵居家照護站"},
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "宇涵居家照護站",
